// The wider Columbus landscape: every independent business we could find
// beyond the hand-built cards in businesses.mjs. Compiled October 2026 from
// the Columbus Area Chamber of Commerce member directory (chamber), Visit
// Columbus Indiana dining and shopping listings (visit), and Google Maps
// category sweeps inside Columbus (maps). National chains, franchises,
// government, schools, nonprofits and out-of-town members were left out.
//
// Only what the listings show is stored: name, the listing's own type,
// address, phone, and the map pin (`ll`, [lat, lng]) where the listing had one. No badges, focus lines or claims; these render as plain
// listing cards. `area` is a neighborhood tag derived from the address so
// search finds "downtown" or "25th St". Phone is blank where no public
// listing we used showed one; the card links to a map search instead.
//
// Regenerate rather than hand-edit large batches; small fixes by hand are fine.

